  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Spinal Meningitis Got Me Down**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **If You Could Save Yourself**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-09-24** (recommended): audience recording; 28 songs; 138 min [1]. Said about its sound: Audience recording; the uploader infers a minidisc or DAT source because no analog tape hiss is audible [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader has seen many acts at the Wiltern, but this was first visit after seats were removed from the floor, allowing dancing [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-09-24**: source: AUD [1]. Also: Received by mail from Phil in Vermont after a WEEN Forum post; wav tracks from CD were compressed to lossless SHN [1]",
